'''Eclipse Moon armour''' is a set of ranged equipment that requires level 75 [[Ranged]] and 50 [[Defence]] to equip, which is obtained as a possible reward from the [[Lunar Chest]] in [[Neypotzli]]. 

It has similar defensive stats to [[steel armour]], but with higher crush and magic defence. 

==Set effect==
'''Eclipse:''' Successful attacks with the [[eclipse atlatl]] gives a 20% chance to inflict a burn on any non-immune target. 

While burning, the target takes 10 '''burn'''[[File:Burn_hitsplat.png]] damage over the course of 40 ticks or 24 seconds (''Seen as 1[[File:Burn_hitsplat.png]] damage every 4 ticks or 2.4 seconds'').  

Each burn has an individual duration and up to five burns can be applied to a target at a time. At maximum stacks, existing burns must expire before a new burn can be applied.

On average, this results in targets taking roughly 2 '''burn''' damage per successful hit of the weapon, which amounts to approximately 1.11 extra damage per second on rapid if every attack was assumed to hit. However because burn deals damage over time, damage is lost if the burn is cleared or the target dies.

It is possible for the set effect to activate even if one or more of the armour pieces are broken. 

