==Repair==
Eclipse Moon armour [[Degradation|degrades]], being usable for 45 hours of continuous combat until it breaks, after which it must be repaired, similar to other [[Moon equipment]].

Having an NPC such as [[Bob]] and [[Dunstan]] repair a fully broken armour piece costs 1,500,000 coins each, while repairing a piece yourself at an [[armour stand]] adds a discount of 7,500 coins per [[Smithing]] level, reducing the price to 757,500 coins at level 99. Boosting to level 104 by using an [[Spicy stew|orange stew]], the price is reduced to 720,000 coins. Repairing all 3 pieces of the set will cost 4,500,000 coins with an NPC down to 2,160,000 coins with boosting at an armour stand.

